        "Heritage Rothschild (4 1/2 × 50) / Robusto (5 1/2 × 52) / Churchill (7 × 49) / Gigante (6 × 60) — national release March 2017; Honduran OSA wrapper",
        "Ramón y Ramón Robusto (5 1/2 × 50) / Maxim Grande (6 × 52) / Gigante (6 × 60) / Fabuloso (7 × 54) — 2016-17; Belita-region Cameroon leaf and the new PM01 variety",
